{"id":11119,"date":"2017-08-01T12:18:44","date_gmt":"2017-08-01T12:18:44","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/?p=11119"},"modified":"2025-03-20T11:41:47","modified_gmt":"2025-03-20T11:41:47","slug":"average-node-js-developer-salary","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/blog\/average-node-js-developer-salary\/","title":{"rendered":"Average Node JS Developer Salary in Europe"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Since its initial release in 1995, JavaScript has become the ubiquitous language of the world wide web, powering all web browsers across all devices and operating systems. Yet universal as it has become, it used to be mostly limited to client-side scripting due to the lack of sufficiently robust implementation of server-side scripting for JavaScript developers. This all changed, however, with the release of Node.js, as it further extended JavaScript\u2019s ubiquity to the server-side territory and to find <a href=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/tech\/hire-node-js-developers\/\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\">nodejs developers for hire<\/a> has become a thing really fast.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1150\" height=\"392\" src=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/learn-the-average-Node-JS-developer-salary-and-hire-JavaScript-developer-easily-1-1.png\" alt=\"learn the average Node JS developer salary and hire JavaScript developer easily\" class=\"wp-image-13935\" title=\"learn the average Node JS developer salary and hire JavaScript developer easily\"\/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why Is Node Developer Salary Changing<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Node.js was created by developer Ryan Dahl in 2009 using C, C++, and JavaScript. It\u2019s a server-side JavaScript run-time environment that allows JavaScript codes to be executed on the server-side. Previously, JavaScript was primarily a client-side language, so it had no access to the server\u2019s components like the processor and memory, but Node.js abolished these limitations and allowed full stack development to use JavaScript. This proved to be extremely useful to web developers, as it essentially broke down the barrier between frontend and backend development, making full stack development exponentially quicker and more convenient. Node.js is therefore often used with other JavaScript-based technologies, such as the <a href=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/tech\/hire-full-stack-developers\/\" title=\"\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\">MEAN stack<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>As we examine the average Node JS developer salary in Europe, it&#8217;s important to highlight the advantages of <a href=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/blog\/hire-developers-in-portugal\/\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\">nearshore Portugal<\/a> collaborations, which offer cost-effective solutions without compromising on talent or time zone convenience.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/contact-us\/\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1150\" height=\"575\" src=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/find-and-hire-junior-node-js-developers-at-Mobilunity-1.png\" alt=\"find and hire junior node js developers at Mobilunity\" class=\"wp-image-13953\" title=\"find and hire junior node js developers at Mobilunity\"\/><\/a><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Node.js Frameworks<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>To make backend development using JavaScript even quicker and easier, several Node.js frameworks have been developed. These are some of the most popular Node.js frameworks available:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/expressjs.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\" title=\"\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">Express.js<\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Hapi.js<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.totaljs.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">Total.js<\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/koajs.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\" title=\"\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">Koa<\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>DerbyJS<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/sailsjs.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\" title=\"\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">Sails.js<\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/keystonejs.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\" title=\"\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">KeystoneJS<\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.meteor.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">Meteor<\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/TOP-reasons-to-get-Node-JS-developers-for-hire-1.png\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"full aligncenter wp-image-13936 size-full\" title=\"TOP reasons to get Node JS developers for hire\" src=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/TOP-reasons-to-get-Node-JS-developers-for-hire-1.png\" alt=\"TOP reasons to get Node JS developers for hire\" width=\"1150\" height=\"738\"><\/a><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key Info on Hiring Node.js Developers<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Node.JS is a runtime environment for JavaScript. Accordingly, a Node expert is someone, who is proficient at JavaScript and uses Node.JS to develop applications for server-side purposes. Node.JS allows to significantly expand JavaScript capabilities, making it usable outside of the browser, and increasing its performance\u2019 speed due to the new V8 engine. To hire Nodejs developer might, in fact, be one of the smartest decisions for any business. A Node.js development company could assist you with plenty of things, which typically differ, depending on the company\u2019s needs. For example, it can be the development of a mobile application. Another task such a specialist could assist you with is back-end development, front-end integrations, and such.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/node-expert-roles-and-responsibilities.png\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1150\" height=\"430\" src=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/node-expert-roles-and-responsibilities.png\" alt=\"node expert roles and responsibilities\" class=\"wp-image-26828\" title=\"node expert roles and responsibilities\"\/><\/a><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n<p>Speaking of roles and responsibilities of a Node.JS developer, it would be fair to outline the following:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">HTML and CSS proficiency.<\/mark><\/span> These are some of the most important tools when it comes to Node.js development and design processes.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">Deep JavaScript knowledge.<\/mark><\/span> This is the main programming language used within the Node.JS environment so its proficiency is crucial for NodeJS developers.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">Front-end development experience.<\/mark><\/span> A great deal of Node.JS connected tasks will be about the integration of the front-end elements.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">Team player.<\/mark><\/span> Successful cooperation with other developers and even other departments is crucial for a Node.js specialist.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">Multitasking skills.<\/mark><\/span><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\"> <\/mark>Sometimes it will be necessary to simultaneously work on a few projects at once.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">Familiarity with different platforms.<\/mark><\/span><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\"> <\/mark>Node.JS programming is being used for various reasons so a potential candidate must be familiar with desktop and mobile platforms.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>In 2020, it is beneficial for companies to hire Node.JS developers as they can significantly speed up the execution time of big projects and are broadening the area of usage of JavaScript.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Node JS Developer Salary<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Here is a typical Node JS developer salary in different countries to help you in finding the most affordable candidate for the project<span data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;node.js developers for hire&quot;}\">.<\/span>&nbsp;In this comparison, we use the salary information website <a href=\"http:\/\/www.payscale.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">PayScale<\/a>, which provides&nbsp;net salaries that&nbsp;exclude taxes, and we compare developers with 1-4 years of experience to make it more accurate. Note that as these are all user-reported salaries, the values may be inaccurate, but they nevertheless provide us with a reasonable comparison of the relative salaries in these countries. Here are the average salaries of Node.js developers with 1-4 years of experience in the USA and Europe:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>US &#8211; <span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$91,251<\/mark><\/span><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>UK &#8211; <a href=\"https:\/\/uk.talent.com\/salary?job=Node+Js\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\"><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$84,777<\/mark><\/span><\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Germany &#8211; <a href=\"https:\/\/www.payscale.com\/research\/DE\/Skill=Node.js\/Salary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\"><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$65,667<\/mark><\/span><\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>France &#8211; <a href=\"https:\/\/www.payscale.com\/research\/FR\/Job=Software_Engineer\/Salary\/05efcd4c\/Paris-JavaScript\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\"><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$53,148<\/mark><\/span><\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ukraine &#8211; <span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$30,000*<\/mark><\/span><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Austria &#8211;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$82,879<\/mark><\/span><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Switzerland &#8211;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.payscale.com\/research\/CH\/Skill=Node.js\/Salary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\"><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\"> $103,433<\/mark><\/span><\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Netherlands &#8211; <a href=\"https:\/\/www.payscale.com\/research\/NL\/Skill=Node.js\/Salary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\"><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$59,103<\/mark><\/span><\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ireland &#8211;&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.payscale.com\/research\/IE\/Skill=Node.js\/Salary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\"><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$51,566<\/mark><\/span><\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Belgium &#8211;&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.payscale.com\/research\/BE\/Skill=Node.js\/Salary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\"><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$50,683<\/mark><\/span><\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"963\" height=\"443\" src=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/node-js-salary-rates.png\" alt=\"node js salary rates\" class=\"wp-image-38575\" title=\"node js salary rates\"\/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">*Ukrainian salaries are provided based on Mobilunity\u2019s Recruitment Team research on the local job markets. All salaries are net and do not include the service fee (in case of hiring on a dedicated team model). The salaries are provided for comparison purposes and could not be entirely accurate.&nbsp;<a data-wpel-link=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/contact-us\/\">Contact us<\/a>&nbsp;to know the exact cost of hiring a developer corresponding to the required parameters.<\/mark><\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>In order to get a complete picture of how devs skilled in this technology are paid across the world, we have made even more thorough research on Node JS developer salary in different countries. It is based on a middle-level programmer wage since senior and junior JavaScript developer salary can be very different for different companies and different projects. The results are as follows.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Europe vs the USA<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>European city<\/td><td>Node.js developer salary\/ Middle-level<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>London<\/td><td><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$6,100<\/mark><\/span><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Paris<\/td><td><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$4,900<\/mark><\/span><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Milan<\/td><td><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$3,750<\/mark><\/span><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Berlin<\/td><td><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$5,600<\/mark><\/span><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Dublin<\/td><td><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$5,500<\/mark><\/span><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Vienna<\/td><td><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$4,400<\/mark><\/span><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.payscale.com\/research\/UA\/Skill=Node.js\/Salary#by_City\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">Kyiv<\/a><\/td><td><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$3,000<\/mark><\/span><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Average Node.js programmer salaries a month in different cities in Europe<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>If to look for an average senior Node JS developer salary in Europe, we will discover that such experts are highly appreciated in the UK and their wage can reach<span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$7,700<\/mark><\/span> as an average. While net junior Node JS developer salary may start from <span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$3,800<\/mark><\/span>. However, Ukraine is one of the most profitable locations to hire developers if you are looking for the most affordable ways of extending your development team.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>American city<\/td><td>Node.js developer salary\/ Middle-level<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.payscale.com\/research\/US\/Skill=Node.js\/Salary#by_City\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">San Francisco, CA<\/a><\/td><td><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$9,700<\/mark><\/span><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.payscale.com\/research\/US\/Skill=Node.js\/Salary#by_City\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">New York, NY<\/a><\/td><td><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$7,700<\/mark><\/span><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.payscale.com\/research\/US\/Skill=Node.js\/Salary#by_City\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">Chicago, IL<\/a><\/td><td><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$6,700<\/mark><\/span><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.payscale.com\/research\/US\/Skill=Node.js\/Salary#by_City\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">Los Angeles, CA<\/a><\/td><td><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$7,300<\/mark><\/span><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.payscale.com\/research\/US\/Skill=Node.js\/Salary#by_City\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">Boston, MA<\/a><\/td><td><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$7,900<\/mark><\/span><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.payscale.com\/research\/US\/Skill=Node.js\/Salary#by_City\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">Seattle, WA<\/a><\/td><td><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$8,000<\/mark><\/span><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Node.js developer wage in top American cities (per month)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The table above presents the results of the average salary of Node.js programmers in some American cities.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/mobilunity.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/08\/Node-JS-developer-salary-in-the-USA-and-Europe.png\" alt=\"Node JS developer salary in the USA and Europe\" class=\"wp-image-14153\" title=\"Node JS developer salary in the USA and Europe\"\/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n<p>As we can see, the indicators are rather different. Still, if to look at the freelance <a href=\"https:\/\/www.payscale.com\/research\/US\/Skill=JavaScript\/Hourly_Rate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">JavaScript developer hourly rate<\/a> across the country, this indicator is <span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$20-60\/per hour<\/mark><\/span> on the average.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The USA vs Canada<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Canadian city<\/td><td>Node.js developer salary\/ Middle-level<\/td><td>American city<\/td><td>Node.js developer salary\/ Middle-level<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.payscale.com\/research\/CA\/Skill=Node.js\/Salary#by_City\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">Montr\u00e9al, QC<\/a><\/td><td><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$4,300<\/mark><\/span><\/td><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.payscale.com\/research\/US\/Skill=Node.js\/Salary#by_City\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">San Francisco, CA<\/a><\/td><td><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$9,700<\/mark><\/span><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.payscale.com\/research\/CA\/Skill=Node.js\/Salary#by_City\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">Toronto, ON<\/a><\/td><td><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$4,800<\/mark><\/span><\/td><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.payscale.com\/research\/US\/Skill=Node.js\/Salary#by_City\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">Boston, MA<\/a><\/td><td><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$7,900<\/mark><\/span><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.payscale.com\/research\/CA\/Skill=Node.js\/Salary#by_City\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">Vancouver, BC<\/a><\/td><td><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$4,600<\/mark><\/span><\/td><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.payscale.com\/research\/US\/Skill=Node.js\/Salary#by_City\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">Los Angeles, CA<\/a><\/td><td><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$7,300<\/mark><\/span><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.payscale.com\/research\/CA\/Skill=Node.js\/Salary#by_City\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">Waterloo, ON<\/a><\/td><td><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$5,400<\/mark><\/span><\/td><td>Seattle, WA<\/td><td><span style=\"color: #ffd800;\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">$8,000<\/mark><\/span><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Comparison of Node developer salary in some cities of the USA and Canada<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This graph depicts a comparison of average Node JS developer salary in American and Canadian cities. You can see that the US salaries are higher regardless of the city. Comparing Node JS developer salary NYC vs the UK vs Canada, we can see that Canadian and UK rates are almost equal, while the US ones are much higher.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Comparison by Technologies<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Finally, we decided to compare Node.js developer salary in the USA, Euro